<title>USA: Emcare Q4 shr loss $0.26 after charge.</title>
<headline>Emcare Q4 shr loss $0.26 after charge.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net revenue					$55,950     $43,744</p>
<p> Net (loss) income				(2,213)	 2,385</p>
<p> Net (loss) income per share		   (0.26)	  0.28</p>
